Theorem CN-3: Shared blocks reuse

  Preconditions:
    - s.uniqueness = Shared
    - s.shape in {ReusableStruct, ReusableEnum, CollectionBuffer, ContextHole}
    - canonicalize_cn3 applies the Shape-collapse rule per Annex E §AIMS

  Soundness property:
    Forall s with (Shared, reusable_shape). canonicalize_cn3(s).shape = NonReusable.

  Proof obligation:
    Finite enumeration over 4 reusable Shape variants x Uniqueness=Shared
    = 4 trigger input states. Negative-case enumeration over (Unique,
    MaybeShared) x 4 reusable shapes verifies non-trigger preservation.

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (finite-state enumeration over the 4-state Shared trigger
        x 8-state negative product per section_03::verify_cn3_shared_blocks_reuse)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_03 case_analysis engine discharges CN-3 via 4-state trigger + 8-state negative enumeration
